		(descr "Two Littelfuse 01250003H (125 series, 30 A) PCB clips for a 10.3 x 38.1 mm Class CC / midget fuse (e.g. Littelfuse KLDR025). Per clip: two 1.2 x 2.5 mm slots 10.80 mm apart; 41.76 mm outer span (125-series datasheet rev 02/07/18). Origin at the fuse centre, X along the fuse axis. Pads 1 = fuse end A, pads 2 = fuse end B. Clip height 18.5 mm above the board. Drawn 2026-10-09 for native-21 stage 12 (validation-results/08-manufacturing-package/native-21/owner-items/f1cc).")
