		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "7b43c059-dc97-43b9-87b5-6aa5f945dcc4")
		(at 38.5 12.6 -90)
		(descr "Bourns CSS2H-2512R-1L00F 1 mOhm shunt, Kelvin land per Bourns 'Model CSS2H-2512 Series' datasheet (bourns.com PDF created 27-Jan-2026) p.2 Recommended Pad Layout. Dimensioned: solder pads 1.80 x 3.40, inner gap 3.40. Measured from the 600 dpi drawing (scale from the 3.40 / 1.80 dimensions, 45.99 px/mm at 200 dpi-equivalent): sense lobe 0.40 tall centred on each pad, from the pad inner edge to |x| 0.30; sense finger 0.40 wide at |x| 0.30..0.70 from y -0.20 to +3.20 (1.50 beyond the pad edge); finger gap 0.60. Pads 1/4 current (I_A LEG_RET / I_B HV_RET), 2/3 sense (lobe + finger, net-tied to 1 / 4). Body 6.35 x 3.05, H 0.78 max (1L00x). No 3D model: enclosure-fit envelope 0.78 mm.")
